  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Side events Agriculture Working Group 2022 Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project enables the embassy in Nairobi to put urgent and current topics on the agenda at a Kenya (KE) - the Netherlands (NL) high level meeting. This meeting is used to gain focus and commitment, especially on the public side for issues around logistics and circular business in the agriculture sector. This is useful for further activities, such as facilitating investments required for agri-logistics and sea freight and facilitating a business climate for circular initiatives. Existing initiatives around sea freight and circular agriculture will also receive more exposure through this high-level meeting, which in turn can benefit local developments.</narrative>
  </description>
